	🟀 ＳＵＭＭＡＲＩＵＭ 🟀

		This is a proposed app that has not yet been started. It's purpose will be 
	to take over the role of building that the Claude desktop client is currently filling.
	Aedificatorium will be a 3 pane textual app with a workflow designed towards taking
	build documents and turning them into implementable modules. The Builder entity will be
	used as the interactive chat operator.


