	🟀 ＡＣＴＩＯ ＰＲＯＸＩＭＡ 🟀

		A few features and tweaks for rounding out would be:

		ⴕ The printing function does not properly respect new lines.
		ⴕ Line Editor needs better slot navigation and conjunction with glyph set window.
		ⴕ Line Editor needs a duplicate line button, (or able to enter how many times it should print) 
		  and space should actually clear the slot.
